Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.58,0:01:41.75,OP,,0,0,0,,曾经凭着冲劲挥舞着「觉悟」
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.75,0:01:44.00,OP,,0,0,0,,却只是徒劳地划破虚空
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.00,0:01:46.04,OP,,0,0,0,,在失落中垂下的双肩
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.04,0:01:48.80,OP,,0,0,0,,那只伸出的手照亮了希望
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.80,0:01:50.05,OP,,0,0,0,,命运的邂逅
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.05,0:01:51.34,OP,,0,0,0,,让我直面自己的脆弱
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.34,0:01:53.84,OP,,0,0,0,,点燃决心的火焰
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.84,0:01:58.85,OP,,0,0,0,,心中的悸动如雷鸣般锐利
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.60,0:02:03.94,OP,,0,0,0,,你那打破孤独的笑容
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.73,0:02:08.90,OP,,0,0,0,,为了不被夺走 我直视黑暗
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.90,0:02:13.82,OP,,0,0,0,,为了不再迷失 我与你同行
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.82,0:02:18.99,OP,,0,0,0,,带你去见从未驻足过绝美景色
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.00,0:02:26.00,OP,,0,0,0,,来吧 用刀锋指向明天
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.00,0:02:31.30,OP,,0,0,0,,夺回真正的强悍
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.30,0:02:36.09,OP,,0,0,0,,回头望去 见到萌芽的羁绊
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.09,0:02:40.43,OP,,0,0,0,,用坚定的誓言守护到底
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.43,0:02:42.39,OP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,280)}这份信念
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.01,0:22:08.64,ED,,0,0,0,,目标前方有光芒绽放
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.64,0:22:11.73,ED,,0,0,0,,不想认输就勇敢奋斗
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.98,0:22:14.73,ED,,0,0,0,,坚毅的志向不动如山
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.73,0:22:17.82,ED,,0,0,0,,放手一搏 和你一起奔向明天 嘿！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.86,0:22:26.12,ED,,0,0,0,,一次又一次
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.12,0:22:28.91,ED,,0,0,0,,热闹登场的大决斗
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.12,0:22:32.33,ED,,0,0,0,,比往日更甚
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.33,0:22:35.00,ED,,0,0,0,,没有底线的破天荒
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.38,0:22:38.30,ED,,0,0,0,,无论做什么都要比个高下
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.30,0:22:41.13,ED,,0,0,0,,哎呀呀 一刻都闲不下来
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.13,0:22:43.93,ED,,0,0,0,,血液还在沸腾 那就决胜负吧
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.93,0:22:45.76,ED,,0,0,0,,直到永远
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.30,0:22:49.85,ED,,0,0,0,,目标前方有光芒绽放
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.85,0:22:53.27,ED,,0,0,0,,与愉快的伙伴们一同前往
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.27,0:22:55.81,ED,,0,0,0,,雄心壮志自有规矩
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.81,0:22:59.23,ED,,0,0,0,,放手一搏 和你一起奔向明天 嘿！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.23,0:23:02.07,ED,,0,0,0,,无论多远都会延续
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.07,0:23:05.07,ED,,0,0,0,,无论多远都能前行
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.07,0:23:07.87,ED,,0,0,0,,无论多远都会延续
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.87,0:23:10.87,ED,,0,0,0,,光芒永不中断
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.24,0:23:14.04,ED,,0,0,0,,夕阳守护着背影
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.04,0:23:16.83,ED,,0,0,0,,温柔的风徐徐吹过
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.21,0:23:19.88,ED,,0,0,0,,你看吧 明天见
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.88,0:23:22.88,ED,,0,0,0,,集中 热衷 修行中！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.13,0:23:25.80,ED,,0,0,0,,目标前方有光芒绽放
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.80,0:23:29.05,ED,,0,0,0,,不想认输就勇敢奋斗
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.22,0:23:31.68,ED,,0,0,0,,坚毅的志向不动如山
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.68,0:23:35.52,ED,,0,0,0,,放手一搏 和你一起奔向明天 嘿！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.90,0:00:07.78,Default,,0,0,0,,这里虽然能实现各种梦想
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.86,0:00:12.95,Default,,0,0,0,,但唯一无法实现的愿望就是离开这世界呱
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.83,0:00:17.25,Default,,0,0,0,,你们也会在这里逐渐说出梦想
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.33,0:00:19.58,Default,,0,0,0,,放弃逃出去的念头
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.67,0:00:20.88,Default,,0,0,0,,然后
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.38,0:00:22.84,Default,,0,0,0,,就这样死去呱
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.55,0:00:25.71,Default,,0,0,0,,所以
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.80,0:00:27.42,Default,,0,0,0,,跟我一起玩吧
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.76,0:00:30.13,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}开什么玩笑？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.22,0:00:33.97,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}我有一大堆想实现的梦想耶
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.06,0:00:35.72,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}快告诉我
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.81,0:00:37.85,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}出口在哪？在哪啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.93,0:00:40.48,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}虽然有出口 可是很危险呱
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.56,0:00:44.23,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}你们死了就不能跟我玩了呱
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.32,0:00:46.73,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}吵死了 快说就对了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.82,0:00:48.44,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}我知道了呱
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.53,0:00:53.37,Default,,0,0,0,,出口就在对面黑暗瀑布的后方
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.45,0:00:54.16,Default,,0,0,0,,真的吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.16,0:00:54.83,Default,,0,0,0,,真的
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.49,0:00:57.33,Default,,0,0,0,,好 十兵卫我们走
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.41,0:00:58.29,Default,,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.37,0:00:59.79,Default,,0,0,0,,等一下呱
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.87,0:01:05.00,Default,,0,0,0,,那座瀑布由叫做阿介的粗暴家伙看守
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.09,0:01:06.25,Default,,0,0,0,,阿介？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.96,0:01:08.51,Default,,0,0,0,,阿介啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.55,0:01:12.01,Default,,0,0,0,,看我怎么把那家伙打扁！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.55,0:01:18.18,Default,,0,0,0,,好不容易才找到能一起玩的人耶
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.12,0:03:04.71,Default,,0,0,0,,刃他们被吸进去已经过了好几个小时
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.79,0:03:07.25,Default,,0,0,0,,到现在连个动静都没有
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.13,0:03:09.29,Default,,0,0,0,,没办法了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.38,0:03:11.88,Default,,0,0,0,,去找下一颗珠子吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.05,0:03:15.76,Default,,0,0,0,,我们总不能一直待在这里吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.34,0:03:19.72,Default,,0,0,0,,我们只能做目前能做的事
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.56,0:03:22.01,Default,,0,0,0,,说的也是
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.10,0:03:25.14,Default,,0,0,0,,也得做好刃大人出来时的准备
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.23,0:03:27.44,Default,,0,0,0,,我们继续去找珠子吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.77,0:03:32.40,Default,,0,0,0,,好 目前还剩下两处
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.48,0:03:36.53,Default,,0,0,0,,我们先去北海道看看吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.61,0:03:37.66,Default,,0,0,0,,刃
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.24,0:03:39.87,Default,,0,0,0,,快点出来啦
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.04,0:03:45.12,Default,,0,0,0,,这里就是黑暗瀑布吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.20,0:03:48.96,Default,,0,0,0,,阿介 出来跟我一决胜负吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.48,0:04:06.93,Default,,0,0,0,,什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.52,0:04:09.02,Default,,0,0,0,,他就是阿介？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.10,0:04:11.44,Default,,0,0,0,,跟想像中的完全不一样
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.52,0:04:13.52,Default,,0,0,0,,你是什么人？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.07,0:04:17.90,Default,,0,0,0,,那个 我们想通过这个出口
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.99,0:04:20.78,Default,,0,0,0,,正是如此
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.49,0:04:24.70,Default,,0,0,0,,好 就让你通过吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.79,0:04:26.58,Default,,0,0,0,,是吗？抱歉啦
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.25,0:04:28.21,Default,,0,0,0,,只是…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.29,0:04:32.17,Default,,0,0,0,,你们得先到我的胃里
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.55,0:04:37.72,Default,,0,0,0,,刃大人！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.22,0:04:44.18,Default,,0,0,0,,好久没遇到这么有骨气的人类了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.26,0:04:47.56,Default,,0,0,0,,这样才吃得过瘾嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.10,0:04:53.86,Default,,0,0,0,,谁要被你这家伙吃掉啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.58,0:05:12.25,Default,,0,0,0,,可恶
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.75,0:05:16.00,Default,,0,0,0,,你们实在是越看越美味呢
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.09,0:05:18.46,Default,,0,0,0,,要怎么料理你们呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.05,0:05:20.72,Default,,0,0,0,,你这家伙…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.97,0:05:27.72,Default,,0,0,0,,好烫…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.35,0:05:30.64,Default,,0,0,0,,刃大人
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.73,0:05:32.73,Default,,0,0,0,,干嘛要灭火？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.81,0:05:34.94,Default,,0,0,0,,烤得还不够熟耶
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.02,0:05:36.73,Default,,0,0,0,,既然如此
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.48,0:05:39.40,Default,,0,0,0,,只好攻击河童的弱点了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.99,0:05:41.28,Default,,0,0,0,,弱点？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.36,0:05:44.53,Default,,0,0,0,,自古以来流传河童的弱点是
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.28,0:05:48.41,Default,,0,0,0,,头上的盘子
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.45,0:05:51.71,Default,,0,0,0,,在下去牵制他
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.79,0:05:53.58,Default,,0,0,0,,你趁机去攻击他的盘子
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.67,0:05:54.63,Default,,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.55,0:06:04.05,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么啦？没打到哦
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.39,0:06:13.19,Default,,0,0,0,,雷电斩！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.98,0:06:21.74,Default,,0,0,0,,就凭你们这点程度 不可能打碎我的盘子
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.49,0:06:24.95,Default,,0,0,0,,刃大人
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.66,0:06:30.91,Default,,0,0,0,,可恶 给我等着
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.00,0:06:32.75,Default,,0,0,0,,我马上就过去
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.88,0:06:41.01,Default,,0,0,0,,啧 逃跑了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.35,0:06:48.26,Default,,0,0,0,,这里是‥
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.31,0:06:51.31,Default,,0,0,0,,你们活着回来了呱
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.39,0:06:52.31,Default,,0,0,0,,阿吉
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.89,0:06:56.48,Default,,0,0,0,,好了 你们知道自己回不去了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.56,0:06:58.94,Default,,0,0,0,,和我一起玩吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.82,0:07:03.65,Default,,0,0,0,,难道你要我一直被困在这里跟你玩到死吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.74,0:07:04.78,Default,,0,0,0,,对呱
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.86,0:07:07.95,Default,,0,0,0,,只要不靠近瀑布就没事了呱
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.45,0:07:10.03,Default,,0,0,0,,可恶
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.12,0:07:12.95,Default,,0,0,0,,果然只能打倒那只巨大河童了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.79,0:07:15.58,Default,,0,0,0,,好 十兵卫 来特训吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.67,0:07:18.96,Default,,0,0,0,,看我的呱
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.04,0:07:21.75,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}你挺有一手的嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.26,0:07:26.01,Default,,0,0,0,,你们在做什么啦！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.09,0:07:28.47,Default,,0,0,0,,十兵卫 振作点
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.55,0:07:31.81,Default,,0,0,0,,继续待在这就拿不到龙神珠了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.89,0:07:33.85,Default,,0,0,0,,也打不倒鬼丸 不是吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.85,0:07:37.48,Default,,0,0,0,,刃大人 你也有这种梦想啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.56,0:07:40.19,Default,,0,0,0,,你也不能进行武者修行了耶
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.27,0:07:42.61,Default,,0,0,0,,武者修行啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.69,0:07:46.45,Default,,0,0,0,,没错 你们会像这样陆续放弃梦想呱
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.53,0:07:47.45,Default,,0,0,0,,闭嘴！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.53,0:07:49.66,Default,,0,0,0,,我才不会放弃
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.74,0:07:50.87,Default,,0,0,0,,我要打倒鬼丸
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.95,0:07:53.08,Default,,0,0,0,,成为天下第一的武士
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.29,0:07:56.54,Default,,0,0,0,,拜托你 十兵卫
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.62,0:07:58.46,Default,,0,0,0,,做我的修行对手吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.54,0:08:00.29,Default,,0,0,0,,我们要打倒那只巨大河童
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.84,0:08:03.34,Default,,0,0,0,,办不到
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.42,0:08:05.05,Default,,0,0,0,,那只大河童
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.13,0:08:08.18,Default,,0,0,0,,并非在下的剑术能对付的对象
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.30,0:08:10.39,Default,,0,0,0,,没错
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.89,0:08:13.72,Default,,0,0,0,,刃大人也尽早放弃
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.81,0:08:16.14,Default,,0,0,0,,悠哉地在这个世界生活吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.39,0:08:19.77,Default,,0,0,0,,十兵卫…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.85,0:08:21.69,Default,,0,0,0,,别这么气馁
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.77,0:08:25.11,Default,,0,0,0,,一起开个宴会热闹一下呱
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.86,0:08:26.74,Default,,0,0,0,,胡说什么…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.70,0:08:30.24,Default,,0,0,0,,这提议不错哦
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.24,0:08:30.66,Default,,0,0,0,,呱
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.16,0:08:39.37,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么样？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.46,0:08:40.79,Default,,0,0,0,,真厉害呱
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.38,0:08:43.09,Default,,0,0,0,,好开心呱
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.76,0:08:49.22,Default,,0,0,0,,来 十兵卫多喝点
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.30,0:08:53.80,Default,,0,0,0,,看来刃大人也放弃要离开这里了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.72,0:08:55.89,Default,,0,0,0,,这比什么都好
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.02,0:09:00.64,Default,,0,0,0,,要现身了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.73,0:09:03.19,Default,,0,0,0,,他…他好像看起来怪怪的呱
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.44,0:09:06.90,Default,,0,0,0,,很危险 你快退下
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.65,0:09:11.61,Default,,0,0,0,,是狼男呱！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.41,0:09:17.79,Default,,0,0,0,,十兵卫只要喝了酒就会变成狼
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.54,0:09:23.04,Default,,0,0,0,,小鬼 又见面啦
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.13,0:09:27.59,Default,,0,0,0,,很好 这下我就能尽情地特训了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.67,0:09:29.34,Default,,0,0,0,,来吧 狼武士
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.42,0:09:32.09,Default,,0,0,0,,来做我的修行对手吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.59,0:09:34.39,Default,,0,0,0,,修行？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.47,0:09:38.06,Default,,0,0,0,,你根本没资格当本大爷的对手
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.14,0:09:40.68,Default,,0,0,0,,少废话 快点进攻
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.27,0:09:43.06,Default,,0,0,0,,别着急 小鬼
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.15,0:09:47.94,Default,,0,0,0,,就让你拜见一下本大爷的必杀剑
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.11,0:09:53.57,Default,,0,0,0,,什…什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.20,0:10:01.83,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么样 小鬼？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.54,0:10:05.29,Default,,0,0,0,,刚才那招是什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.30,0:10:09.96,Default,,0,0,0,,柳生新阴流
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.05,0:10:12.47,Default,,0,0,0,,疾风太刀
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.05,0:10:14.84,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}原来如此 是招式啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.93,0:10:17.93,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}那我也想一个新的来用就好了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.01,0:10:20.60,Default,,0,0,0,,你…你们俩快住手呱
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.68,0:10:22.64,Default,,0,0,0,,要一起和乐融融地玩游戏呱
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.73,0:10:24.48,Default,,0,0,0,,这河童看起来真美味
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.56,0:10:27.40,Default,,0,0,0,,晚点就把你做成河童卷
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.48,0:10:29.02,Default,,0,0,0,,给我等着
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.03,0:10:30.90,Default,,0,0,0,,阿吉
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.32,0:10:36.37,Default,,0,0,0,,可恶
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.87,0:10:39.95,Default,,0,0,0,,这招如何？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.67,0:10:47.42,Default,,0,0,0,,耍猴戏的小鬼
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.50,0:10:50.55,Default,,0,0,0,,想使用那招 你还早了十万年
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.13,0:10:54.05,Default,,0,0,0,,你说什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.02,0:11:08.98,Default,,0,0,0,,用我的招式把铁刃…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.03,0:11:13.11,Default,,0,0,0,,可恶！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.07,0:11:21.87,Default,,0,0,0,,不行 这还算不上是招式
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.45,0:11:24.08,Default,,0,0,0,,鬼丸大人
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.16,0:11:28.21,Default,,0,0,0,,五右卫门被刃他们打败了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.29,0:11:31.21,Default,,0,0,0,,现在不是悠哉地挥剑的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.00,0:11:33.88,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}这个蠢材
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.47,0:11:37.84,Default,,0,0,0,,这情报我早就知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.80,0:11:41.26,Default,,0,0,0,,太碍眼了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.26,0:11:43.81,Default,,0,0,0,,给我退下！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.52,0:11:48.81,Default,,0,0,0,,对…对不起！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.57,0:11:58.91,Default,,0,0,0,,就是这个
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.49,0:12:02.20,Default,,0,0,0,,干得好 蜘蛛男
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.92,0:12:14.13,Default,,0,0,0,,蠢蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.21,0:12:15.51,Default,,0,0,0,,还搞不懂吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.09,0:12:21.68,Default,,0,0,0,,这个招式
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.97,0:12:24.43,Default,,0,0,0,,像风一样飘舞
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.52,0:12:26.64,Default,,0,0,0,,如疾风般斩击的招式
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.64,0:12:30.85,Default,,0,0,0,,你再怎么学 也只会转成风车
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.94,0:12:32.15,Default,,0,0,0,,吵死了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.23,0:12:34.94,Default,,0,0,0,,我就让你见识风车的可怕
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.03,0:12:36.86,Default,,0,0,0,,拔…拔不出来
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.91,0:12:42.20,Default,,0,0,0,,我赢定了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.75,0:12:52.79,Default,,0,0,0,,结束了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.01,0:12:57.01,Default,,0,0,0,,什…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.59,0:12:59.51,Default,,0,0,0,,什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.72,0:13:07.52,Default,,0,0,0,,刃先生
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.60,0:13:09.10,Default,,0,0,0,,你没事呱？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.06,0:13:12.31,Default,,0,0,0,,有没有受伤呱？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.98,0:13:14.82,Default,,0,0,0,,刃先生？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.48,0:13:17.07,Default,,0,0,0,,成功了！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.15,0:13:20.15,Default,,0,0,0,,我学会新招式了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.49,0:13:25.62,Default,,0,0,0,,命名为
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.70,0:13:30.41,Default,,0,0,0,,「铁刃新阴流风车」
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.89,0:13:51.35,Default,,0,0,0,,必杀
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.44,0:13:53.35,Default,,0,0,0,,龙卷斩！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.32,0:14:03.32,Default,,0,0,0,,就是这个
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.49,0:14:07.53,Default,,0,0,0,,我终于将必杀剑化为己有
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.75,0:14:19.88,Default,,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.96,0:14:23.38,Default,,0,0,0,,就用这招给那只巨大河童一点教训
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.64,0:14:26.76,Default,,0,0,0,,在下是…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.64,0:14:29.14,Default,,0,0,0,,十兵卫 我们走
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.14,0:14:33.52,Default,,0,0,0,,刃大人 怎么突然说要走？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.60,0:14:35.19,Default,,0,0,0,,我学会了新招式
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.27,0:14:36.52,Default,,0,0,0,,准备去黑暗瀑布吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.11,0:14:38.65,Default,,0,0,0,,我们要打倒阿介
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.73,0:14:41.03,Default,,0,0,0,,回到原本的世界
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.82,0:14:44.74,Default,,0,0,0,,你还在说这种蠢话吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.82,0:14:45.66,Default,,0,0,0,,蠢话？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.74,0:14:47.28,Default,,0,0,0,,对呱
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.37,0:14:50.08,Default,,0,0,0,,别做无谓的挣扎 来跟我来呱
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.16,0:14:51.08,Default,,0,0,0,,吵死了！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.16,0:14:54.37,Default,,0,0,0,,我没闲工夫在这里跟你耗
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.46,0:14:57.00,Default,,0,0,0,,你怎么又在讲自己的梦想？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.08,0:14:59.46,Default,,0,0,0,,快放弃梦想呱
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.75,0:15:03.34,Default,,0,0,0,,就算你真的成功脱离这个世界
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.42,0:15:05.26,Default,,0,0,0,,为了实现那个梦想
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.34,0:15:08.97,Default,,0,0,0,,也只有艰难的战斗和辛苦的修行在等着你呱
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.05,0:15:10.97,Default,,0,0,0,,这样一点也不开心呱
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.60,0:15:14.18,Default,,0,0,0,,阿吉我跟你说
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.10,0:15:16.31,Default,,0,0,0,,所谓的梦想
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.40,0:15:19.02,Default,,0,0,0,,就是很难实现才叫做梦想啊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.77,0:15:22.32,Default,,0,0,0,,如果不管怎么努力都无法实现
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.40,0:15:23.53,Default,,0,0,0,,那该怎么办呱？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.61,0:15:25.57,Default,,0,0,0,,这个嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.65,0:15:26.82,Default,,0,0,0,,到时候…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.66,0:15:32.54,Default,,0,0,0,,就去寻找新的梦想吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.58,0:15:40.75,Default,,0,0,0,,既然如此 在下也一起去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.13,0:15:43.88,Default,,0,0,0,,在下和你一样
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.96,0:15:45.63,Default,,0,0,0,,是想成为天下第一的武士
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.55,0:15:50.60,Default,,0,0,0,,那就必须仔细拜见你的必杀剑了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.51,0:15:52.51,Default,,0,0,0,,我们走
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.18,0:15:56.27,Default,,0,0,0,,等…等一下
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.02,0:16:01.32,Default,,0,0,0,,梦想吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.73,0:16:04.61,Default,,0,0,0,,真是一群有趣的人
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.74,0:16:10.91,Default,,0,0,0,,大河童
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.62,0:16:13.45,Default,,0,0,0,,再跟我决胜负一次
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.37,0:16:15.37,Default,,0,0,0,,别笑死人了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.83,0:16:18.67,Default,,0,0,0,,可恶
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.33,0:16:20.75,Default,,0,0,0,,这样根本无法靠近
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.68,0:16:30.26,Default,,0,0,0,,刃大人 就是现在
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.34,0:16:31.68,Default,,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.76,0:16:33.26,Default,,0,0,0,,大河童
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.35,0:16:36.39,Default,,0,0,0,,吃我的新必杀剑吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.68,0:16:39.65,Default,,0,0,0,,铁刃新阴流
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.23,0:16:41.73,Default,,0,0,0,,风车！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.78,0:16:49.24,Default,,0,0,0,,这种程度的招式
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.32,0:16:51.03,Default,,0,0,0,,还敢称之为必杀剑？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.74,0:16:55.29,Default,,0,0,0,,奇怪了…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.58,0:17:02.42,Default,,0,0,0,,终于想被我吃掉了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.00,0:17:05.17,Default,,0,0,0,,回转速度不够
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.25,0:17:06.59,Default,,0,0,0,,等一下
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.13,0:17:09.55,Default,,0,0,0,,我记得那时…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.43,0:17:11.43,Default,,0,0,0,,对了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.31,0:17:17.68,Default,,0,0,0,,铁刃新阴流
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.44,0:17:25.94,Default,,0,0,0,,风车！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.82,0:17:29.78,Default,,0,0,0,,别小看我！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.41,0:17:35.58,Default,,0,0,0,,什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.67,0:17:46.30,Default,,0,0,0,,怎…么会？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.80,0:17:54.64,Default,,0,0,0,,成…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.72,0:17:56.97,Default,,0,0,0,,成功了！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.06,0:17:59.64,Default,,0,0,0,,靠着倾斜刀剑改变轨道
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.73,0:18:01.52,Default,,0,0,0,,设想得真周到
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.73,0:18:05.77,Default,,0,0,0,,好 从瀑布后面的出口离开这里吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.86,0:18:06.98,Default,,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.03,0:18:16.58,Default,,0,0,0,,什么嘛？到处都没看到出口啊
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.04,0:18:22.04,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么回事？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.25,0:18:28.17,Default,,0,0,0,,好惊人
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.92,0:18:31.88,Default,,0,0,0,,看来这是往出口的楼梯
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.18,0:18:36.30,Default,,0,0,0,,这声音是…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.39,0:18:37.76,Default,,0,0,0,,沙也加！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.18,0:18:40.64,Default,,0,0,0,,你…你是谁啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.72,0:18:43.19,Default,,0,0,0,,我是弁庆
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.27,0:18:45.40,Default,,0,0,0,,不想吃苦头的话
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.48,0:18:47.90,Default,,0,0,0,,就立刻把珠子交出来
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.86,0:18:51.78,Default,,0,0,0,,你们应该拥有跟我一样的珠子
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.16,0:18:59.49,Default,,0,0,0,,北海道的珠子已经被你找到了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.58,0:19:02.45,Default,,0,0,0,,那就由我们收下你的珠子吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.58,0:19:05.37,Default,,0,0,0,,你说什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.05,0:19:14.67,Default,,0,0,0,,我…我的腰
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.22,0:19:16.64,Default,,0,0,0,,你怎么又闪到腰？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.72,0:19:18.64,Default,,0,0,0,,这种时候是要怎么办啦？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.22,0:19:21.60,Default,,0,0,0,,立刻…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.35,0:19:25.02,Default,,0,0,0,,把珠子交出来！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.60,0:19:27.27,Default,,0,0,0,,刃！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.83,0:19:41.87,Default,,0,0,0,,重获自由的空气真香
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.95,0:19:43.54,Default,,0,0,0,,-刃\N-刃大人
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.41,0:19:46.37,Default,,0,0,0,,十兵卫
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.62,0:19:48.88,Default,,0,0,0,,成功脱离了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.71,0:19:52.05,Default,,0,0,0,,这是…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.80,0:19:55.01,Default,,0,0,0,,那是弁庆的珠子
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.09,0:19:55.92,Default,,0,0,0,,不可以拿来用
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.18,0:19:59.43,Default,,0,0,0,,新珠子啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.01,0:20:01.47,Default,,0,0,0,,正合我意
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.68,0:20:03.52,Default,,0,0,0,,你又来了！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.60,0:20:07.02,Default,,0,0,0,,就用我的新招式和这颗珠子
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.10,0:20:09.10,Default,,0,0,0,,打倒这只混账牛
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.81,0:20:12.36,Default,,0,0,0,,去死吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.82,0:20:22.08,Default,,0,0,0,,结冻了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.91,0:20:24.58,Default,,0,0,0,,那…那颗珠子
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.33,0:20:27.04,Default,,0,0,0,,是冰珠吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.04,0:20:31.42,Default,,0,0,0,,铁刃新阴流
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.13,0:20:34.05,Default,,0,0,0,,风车！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.56,0:20:49.90,Default,,0,0,0,,弁庆 成佛吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.40,0:20:56.07,Default,,0,0,0,,刃 你没事吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.15,0:20:58.07,Default,,0,0,0,,我很担心你耶
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.99,0:21:02.03,Default,,0,0,0,,幸好你们成功从暗珠出来了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.12,0:21:04.16,Default,,0,0,0,,这件事说来话长
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.16,0:21:07.16,Default,,0,0,0,,不过这么一来
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.25,0:21:12.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}七颗珠子已经收集到第六颗了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.50,0:21:14.09,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}这么说来
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.96,0:21:17.17,Default,,0,0,0,,位于东北的最后那一颗
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.26,0:21:19.84,Default,,0,0,0,,铁定就是龙神珠没错了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.93,0:21:23.39,Default,,0,0,0,,最后才出现我们要的珠子
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.47,0:21:25.81,Default,,0,0,0,,该说我们的运气很差吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.85,0:21:31.19,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}这下终于可以拿到龙神珠了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.66,0:21:43.91,Default,,0,0,0,,话说回来 这里是…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.99,0:21:45.66,Default,,0,0,0,,是北海道
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.74,0:21:47.79,Default,,0,0,0,,你们在玩耍的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.87,0:21:49.87,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}沙也加跟我们可是吃足了苦头
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.87,0:21:49.87,Default,,0,0,0,,我记得
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.96,0:21:53.46,Default,,0,0,0,,这好像是前任持有者的记忆
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.09,0:21:58.76,Default,,0,0,0,,这家伙到底是谁？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.69,0:23:37.69,Default,,0,0,0,,古寺幽暗处
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.77,0:23:40.36,Default,,0,0,0,,黑影悄藏猿猴踪 不见其真身
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.44,0:23:42.90,Default,,0,0,0,,下集 猴子芭蕉的计划
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.78,0:23:44.65,Default,,0,0,0,,纵有千般难
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.74,0:23:46.95,Default,,0,0,0,,若能携手同行走 幸福自然来
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.03,0:23:50.03,Default,,0,0,0,,刃大人 我随时准备好要嫁给你哦
